{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32649","headline":"代友人悼姬 · 刘沧","name":"代友人悼姬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"罗帐香微冷锦裀，歌声永绝想梁尘。\n萧郎独宿落花夜，谢女不归明月春。\n青鸟罢传相寄字，碧江无复采莲人。\n满庭芳草坐成恨，迢遰蓬莱入梦频。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32649.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32649","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}